11:02 페이커 ...주인공등장씬;;;

린킨파크 보컬 여자로 바뀌고 처음 보는 무대입니다.체스터배닝턴을 대체할수있을까 편견을 가지고 들어봤는데
그룹에 잘 어울리네요... 소름돋았음.

@9:14 CHILLS bro. Amazing performance by Mia that scene is the pivotal scene that really hooked me into the series

Also the animator that got to work ton the Ekko/Jinx fight scene and used his son as reference nearly gave me the tears. Such a precious moment that translated so beautifully onscreen.

I'm so glad this show is snagging up awards like crazy and getting all this recognition. Seeing the hardworking and deification they all put into this project throughout this documentary just shows how much the earned and deserved it's praise.
